WEBVTT

00:07.616 --> 00:09.376
[If you don't turn yourself in,
your limbs will rot and you'll die]

00:37.833 --> 00:41.153
[All characters and events are fictional,
and any resemblance is coincidental]

00:41.153 --> 00:43.733
[Scenes with children and animals were filmed
safely under professional supervision]

00:56.533 --> 00:58.667
Did I hear that wrong?

01:20.900 --> 01:22.667
Aren't you gonna keep humming?

01:24.833 --> 01:28.300
At first, it was just about
scaring people a little.

01:29.667 --> 01:33.433
But I kind of liked it
when people were afraid of me.

01:33.433 --> 01:36.300
Like I've become someone important.

01:37.167 --> 01:41.600
Then, was there a first incident
that led you to commit murder?

01:41.600 --> 01:45.267
What's wrong with today?

01:45.267 --> 01:49.867
It all started with just a stone.

01:49.867 --> 01:51.633
Who is there?

01:58.867 --> 02:01.300
Is anyone there?

02:08.633 --> 02:11.800
If I hadn't been hit by that stone,

02:11.800 --> 02:14.496
or if I hadn't been seen,

02:14.496 --> 02:16.064
would things have been different?

02:18.000 --> 02:21.233
It started by accident,

02:21.233 --> 02:23.900
but it also feels like my fate.

02:24.533 --> 02:26.464
Have you

02:26.464 --> 02:31.136
ever been found out as the killer?

02:33.367 --> 02:34.867
I guess not.

02:34.867 --> 02:39.300
If I had, I wouldn't have gotten away
with it this long, right?

02:39.300 --> 02:41.767
Don't you agree?

02:50.900 --> 02:52.400
Here, please have some.

02:52.400 --> 02:54.967
Wow, thank you!

02:54.967 --> 02:56.467
[Episode 7]
You are Seok Man's sister-in-law, right?

02:56.467 --> 02:58.333
He works at my house,

02:58.333 --> 03:00.633
but now we're just like siblings.

03:00.633 --> 03:03.367
I thought you were siblings
since you always took such good care of him.

03:03.367 --> 03:04.767
Oh, family is nothing special.

03:04.767 --> 03:07.133
If you live together like this,
everyone becomes family.

03:07.133 --> 03:09.400
Still, I feel bad for Seok Man.

03:09.400 --> 03:12.267
His family scattered everywhere
looking for work.

03:12.267 --> 03:15.600
He came here when he was about eighteen.

03:16.700 --> 03:20.967
Do you happen to know
when he started limping?

03:20.967 --> 03:24.400
I heard he had polio when he was young.

03:25.300 --> 03:26.300
So he can't run?

03:26.300 --> 03:29.000
Oh dear, how could he run with those legs?

03:29.000 --> 03:33.000
Even walking is hard for him,
as he's always unsteady.

03:41.100 --> 03:44.633
When we get to the hospital,
behave and get treated properly.

03:44.633 --> 03:46.767
Don't cause trouble.

03:47.467 --> 03:49.067
Alright.

03:54.592 --> 03:55.616
[Police]

04:08.767 --> 04:11.700
- What is this?
- We're from the prosecutor's office.

04:11.700 --> 04:14.200
We're here to transfer
Lee Ki Beom to the detention center.

04:14.200 --> 04:16.467
Pardon?

04:16.467 --> 04:18.033
We haven't received any notice about that.

04:18.033 --> 04:19.833
Then check with the station.

04:19.833 --> 04:22.367
- What are you waiting for? Get him out.
- Yes, sir.

04:23.700 --> 04:25.400
Wait a minute!

04:25.400 --> 04:27.167
Wait!

04:29.600 --> 04:32.267
Who gave you permission for this? Huh?

04:32.267 --> 04:35.167
You can't just do this all of a sudden! Wait!

04:40.933 --> 04:43.267
Lee Ki Beom has been safely
transferred to the detention center.

04:43.267 --> 04:44.467
[Kangseng, Muwon]
Visitations are also banned.

04:44.467 --> 04:47.033
Alright, thank you for your hard work.

04:47.033 --> 04:49.233
You can head home from there.

04:51.133 --> 04:54.267
No need to worry.
I've taken care of everything.

04:54.267 --> 04:56.633
Thank you for your help!

04:56.633 --> 04:59.767
I told you, you shouldn't beat him so badly.

04:59.767 --> 05:04.067
I just lost my temper
when I heard you were attacked, sir.

05:06.767 --> 05:11.800
Wow, I didn't know
you guys cared about me this much.

05:12.467 --> 05:15.367
Well, if that's the reason,

05:15.367 --> 05:17.408
I should

05:17.408 --> 05:19.667
take responsibility
for both of you till the end.

05:19.667 --> 05:21.500
Thank you!

05:22.567 --> 05:23.833
Get back to your work.

05:23.833 --> 05:27.300
Yes, I'll get going, sir.

05:34.267 --> 05:36.200
Thank you!

05:44.400 --> 05:47.467
Hey, is this really
something to be thankful for?

05:47.467 --> 05:50.100
That punk made us do everything.

05:54.933 --> 05:56.000
Listen.

05:56.704 --> 05:58.533
Watch what you say.

05:58.533 --> 06:02.733
If either of us mentions Prosecutor Cha,
we're both done.

06:04.033 --> 06:05.733
Keep that in mind.

06:17.600 --> 06:20.000
Seok Man, now,

06:21.200 --> 06:24.867
do you remember the faces
of the detectives who arrested Ki Beom?

06:26.500 --> 06:27.567
Yeah.

06:27.567 --> 06:29.567
Point them out for me.

06:31.567 --> 06:33.333
[Investigation Division]
These two here.

06:33.333 --> 06:36.567
Jang Myeong Do, Do Hyeong Gu.

06:40.667 --> 06:43.767
You knew Ki Beom's family
was looking for him.

06:43.767 --> 06:45.167
But why didn't you say anything?

06:45.167 --> 06:48.500
They said they wouldn't
let me off if I talked.

06:48.500 --> 06:52.933
So these two are the ones who threatened you?

06:52.933 --> 06:54.767
Yeah.

07:04.267 --> 07:05.967
But Seok Man,

07:07.433 --> 07:09.867
why were you there that day?

07:09.867 --> 07:12.133
I mean, around Lee Joo Hee's place.

07:12.133 --> 07:13.933
And at that hour,

07:13.933 --> 07:16.667
with your bad leg.

07:17.600 --> 07:19.367
Well, that's...

07:23.067 --> 07:27.100
I don't really remember. Is that important?

07:29.367 --> 07:31.333
That's okay.

07:32.133 --> 07:33.700
That can happen.

07:33.700 --> 07:36.367
I forget things all the time.

07:42.900 --> 07:48.867
[Kangseng Police Station]

07:49.600 --> 07:51.500
Thank you for all the trouble.

07:52.200 --> 07:53.967
It's nothing.

07:58.233 --> 07:59.867
Seok Man.

07:59.867 --> 08:02.733
What kind of guy is Ki Beom, in your opinion?

08:02.733 --> 08:05.344
- Ki Beom?
- Yeah.

08:05.344 --> 08:07.005
Well,

08:08.100 --> 08:11.633
he's good-looking, kind,

08:11.633 --> 08:14.267
and popular with women.

08:15.000 --> 08:17.300
But what makes you ask?

08:17.300 --> 08:21.233
It feels like someone
is deliberately framing him.

08:21.233 --> 08:24.133
Like they hold a grudge against him.

08:24.133 --> 08:26.400
Anyone comes to mind?

08:27.533 --> 08:30.967
There are a few guys who pick fights
with Ki Beom sometimes.

08:30.967 --> 08:32.767
What kind of guys?

08:33.767 --> 08:38.133
They say he flirts with all the women
in the neighborhood.

08:38.133 --> 08:42.400
I guess they're jealous
because Ki Beom is so popular.

08:43.232 --> 08:48.033
That's ridiculous, don't you think?

08:49.733 --> 08:51.533
I should get going now.

08:51.533 --> 08:52.567
Okay.

08:52.567 --> 08:54.533
Sorry, I can't even take you home.

08:54.533 --> 08:56.733
It's fine. I'll just take the bus.

08:56.733 --> 08:58.333
Alright.

09:29.500 --> 09:32.300
What are you doing here?

09:32.300 --> 09:34.667
Your daughter-in-law made me promise
before she left.

09:34.667 --> 09:36.133
She told me to make sure
you take your medicine.

09:36.133 --> 09:38.700
She had no one else to ask,
so she came to you?

09:38.700 --> 09:41.333
Forget it. Take that away.

09:41.333 --> 09:44.333
You don't need to do this anymore.

09:44.333 --> 09:46.867
We're nothing to each other now.

09:50.500 --> 09:53.033
Even if you hate me,
please take your medicine.

09:54.967 --> 09:59.867
Everyone is blaming Ki Beom.
Are you just going to lie here?

10:00.667 --> 10:04.767
We should tell them that Ki Beom
isn't like that, and he's innocent.

10:04.767 --> 10:08.433
If they don't believe us,
we'll say it a thousand times.

10:09.367 --> 10:11.400
It's too much for me to handle it alone.

10:11.400 --> 10:14.433
So please, get your strength back.

10:16.467 --> 10:18.200
Here.

10:52.000 --> 10:55.867
[Witness Statement Record]

10:55.867 --> 10:59.400
With a statement like this,
Lee Ki Beom could be found not guilty.

10:59.400 --> 11:03.967
Please open an internal investigation
into Jang Myeong Do and Do Hyeong Gu.

11:03.967 --> 11:07.867
We can't even question the victim,
and you want an internal investigation?

11:07.867 --> 11:10.367
We can't question the victim?
What do you mean?

11:10.367 --> 11:15.000
Today, Lee Ki Beom was transferred to
the detention center. No visits permitted.

11:15.767 --> 11:18.767
Si Young was one step ahead of us.

11:18.767 --> 11:23.067
So why would you reveal
your hand to the enemy like that?

11:23.067 --> 11:26.816
Ugh, jeez...

11:28.800 --> 11:32.433
What now? We already took a hit like that.

11:32.433 --> 11:35.067
Want me to tell you that punk's weakness?

11:37.267 --> 11:39.600
Why would I turn it down?

11:41.933 --> 11:44.000
Come here, closer.

11:44.000 --> 11:47.967
I shouldn't be saying this as his brother,
but I feel bad for you, so I'll tell you.

11:50.000 --> 11:52.200
He's

11:52.200 --> 11:54.533
basically still a kid.

11:54.533 --> 11:57.696
He's still scared of his father.

11:57.696 --> 12:03.067
He'll do anything to
avoid disappointing his father.

12:09.067 --> 12:11.300
[Kangseng Daily]

12:11.300 --> 12:12.667
Wait, is that true?

12:12.667 --> 12:14.533
Yes, we secured a witness.

12:14.533 --> 12:16.900
Illegal arrest, and even the victim's purse.

12:16.900 --> 12:19.867
If that's true, then Ki Beom
might not be the real killer.

12:19.867 --> 12:23.933
Actually, Lee Ki Beom confessed to
everything the day he was arrested.

12:23.933 --> 12:25.600
Was he tortured or something?

12:25.600 --> 12:27.133
I knew it.

12:27.133 --> 12:30.667
Ki Beom isn't the kind of guy
who could kill someone.

12:31.633 --> 12:33.933
We should break the news first.

12:33.933 --> 12:35.600
Think this through.

12:35.600 --> 12:38.633
But if Lee Ki Beom is the real killer,
we'll face backlash.

12:38.633 --> 12:41.800
We still have to report it.
That's what journalists do.

12:41.800 --> 12:43.200
Ji Won!

12:43.200 --> 12:44.833
Yeah.

12:44.833 --> 12:46.167
Someone came to see you.

12:46.167 --> 12:47.900
Who?

12:52.700 --> 12:53.967
Do what?

12:53.967 --> 12:55.100
A favor.

12:55.100 --> 12:58.200
[Kangseng Daily]
Just add one sentence to your article.

12:58.200 --> 13:02.467
"The special investigation team
has found another prime suspect."

13:04.167 --> 13:06.033
First of all, is that even true?

13:07.300 --> 13:09.133
Who is that?

13:10.467 --> 13:13.467
I can't reveal that yet.

13:16.967 --> 13:18.767
Don't worry. I'm not bluffing.

13:18.767 --> 13:22.233
If you can't even reveal it, why publish it?

13:22.233 --> 13:24.200
Ki Beom's been locked up in the detention.

13:24.200 --> 13:26.200
Visitation is banned,
so I can't even see him.

13:26.200 --> 13:28.000
- What?
- They've completely silenced him,

13:28.000 --> 13:30.300
so we can't even start the investigation.

13:30.300 --> 13:33.600
Now Ki Beom can't get out
based only on Im Seok Man's testimony.

13:33.600 --> 13:35.333
This is insane.

13:35.333 --> 13:37.367
If we say a new suspect has appeared,

13:37.367 --> 13:39.733
they won't be able to
treat Ki Beom recklessly like before.

13:39.733 --> 13:42.667
Because they might think
he's not the real killer.

13:42.667 --> 13:47.233
So you're saying you didn't even
report the suspect to the police?

13:50.633 --> 13:53.233
The suspect is Im Seok Man, right?

13:55.467 --> 13:57.033
That's right, huh?

13:57.033 --> 14:00.033
I had a bad feeling when you kept asking
whether he could run or not.

14:00.033 --> 14:03.300
First Ki Beom, then Ki Hwan,
and now Seok Man?

14:04.233 --> 14:06.633
Is this because of Park Ae Sook's purse?
That's why you suspect Seok Man?

14:06.633 --> 14:08.000
There's even more.

14:08.000 --> 14:11.733
Ki Beom was arrested in front of
Lee Joo Hee's place, where she was killed.

14:11.733 --> 14:14.533
And Seok Man witnessed it,

14:14.533 --> 14:17.533
meaning he was there
at the time of the murder.

14:17.533 --> 14:19.100
But Seok Man's limping...

14:19.100 --> 14:21.100
So,

14:21.100 --> 14:22.200
I'm going to check it out.

14:22.200 --> 14:23.733
Check out what?

14:23.733 --> 14:25.100
Whether he can run or not?

14:25.100 --> 14:26.667
No.

14:26.667 --> 14:28.700
Even if he can't run,

14:28.700 --> 14:30.667
whether he could still commit the crime.

14:30.667 --> 14:33.333
That day, the killer definitely chased me.

14:33.333 --> 14:35.500
Did you see him running?

14:36.333 --> 14:38.733
Of course he ran, if he was chasing me.

14:38.733 --> 14:40.333
He hit me with a rock.

14:40.333 --> 14:41.733
What if he threw it instead?

14:41.733 --> 14:44.800
You're making a big story out of this.

14:44.800 --> 14:47.433
Don't worry. I won't act rashly.

14:47.433 --> 14:49.733
I'm going to check every step carefully.

14:49.733 --> 14:51.520
Until then,

14:51.520 --> 14:54.867
the suspect's identity
will be kept strictly confidential.

14:54.867 --> 14:57.033
Please write the article.

14:57.033 --> 14:58.688
Even if I can't show my hand,

14:58.688 --> 15:02.500
they need to know
theirs might be a losing one.

15:11.433 --> 15:12.867
What did Tae Joo say?

15:12.867 --> 15:14.600
Did he tell you not to publish the article?

15:14.600 --> 15:16.333
Do you have a ball or something?

15:16.333 --> 15:18.133
A ball?

15:18.133 --> 15:21.500
Stand here for a moment, okay?

15:21.500 --> 15:25.800
When I give the signal, throw this. Got it?

15:25.800 --> 15:28.133
Hit you with this? Won't it hurt?

15:28.133 --> 15:30.333
Talk after you hit me.

15:30.333 --> 15:32.100
Okay.

15:32.100 --> 15:35.500
Start!

15:35.500 --> 15:37.600
One,

15:37.600 --> 15:39.233
two,

15:39.233 --> 15:41.100
three,

15:41.100 --> 15:42.933
four,

15:42.933 --> 15:45.233
five... now!

15:57.267 --> 15:59.200
Ji Won...

16:10.600 --> 16:14.033
Ji Won, what happened?

16:14.033 --> 16:15.733
Did it hit you?

16:17.033 --> 16:19.233
You...

16:19.233 --> 16:20.600
What?

16:20.600 --> 16:22.267
It hit, huh?

16:23.367 --> 16:26.467
I... almost got hit.

16:27.800 --> 16:30.100
Darn it.

16:30.100 --> 16:32.133
That actually works?

16:40.100 --> 16:41.933
Yeah?

16:41.933 --> 16:44.100
Right.

16:44.100 --> 16:48.267
Have the rest join
the special investigation team as planned.

16:50.600 --> 16:52.467
Why bring in a special investigation team?

16:52.467 --> 16:55.400
The case is basically wrapped up.
Is it necessary?

16:55.400 --> 16:57.367
At Kang Tae Joo's request.

16:57.367 --> 16:58.400
What?

16:58.400 --> 17:02.933
I thought you two were friends.
Guess you're not that close.

17:15.933 --> 17:17.216
[Real killer caught, or a forced confession?]
A prime suspect

17:17.216 --> 17:18.900
in the Kangseng serial killings, Mr. Lee,

17:18.900 --> 17:22.633
has been found to have been illegally
arrested by the police, sparking controversy.

17:22.633 --> 17:25.700
It has been confirmed that he was
actually apprehended five days earlier

17:25.700 --> 17:27.800
- than the arrest date announced by police.
- Where's Prosecutor Cha?

17:27.800 --> 17:29.760
- He stepped out for a moment.
- What he went through during that time

17:29.760 --> 17:31.133
remains unknown.

17:31.133 --> 17:33.867
Mr. Lee confessed all crimes
immediately after arrest,

17:33.867 --> 17:38.733
but there are suspicions he was
coerced or abused during detention.

17:38.733 --> 17:41.333
If it's revealed as a coerced confession,

17:41.333 --> 17:43.500
the repercussions will be even greater.

17:43.500 --> 17:48.333
Meanwhile, a newly formed task force
has identified another key suspect,

17:48.333 --> 17:51.633
so the focus is on which of the two suspects
is the real killer.

17:51.633 --> 17:54.033
Put together the internal audit team.

17:54.033 --> 17:56.267
Immediately!

18:00.267 --> 18:03.400
[Real killer caught, or a forced confession?]
"Another prime suspect?"

18:05.100 --> 18:08.100
That punk's even hiding his cards from me?

18:08.100 --> 18:10.867
The police announced they will
use the latest forensic techniques

18:10.867 --> 18:14.033
to identify the real killer.

18:26.500 --> 18:28.133
Detective Kang!

18:28.867 --> 18:30.700
I need to talk to you.

18:33.900 --> 18:37.067
A prime suspect even the prosecutor
doesn't know about?

18:38.233 --> 18:41.767
"Prime suspect"? We're investigating
because there's suspicion.

18:41.767 --> 18:43.467
Anyway, Ms. Seo's been
hearing things somewhere...

18:43.467 --> 18:44.500
Why didn't you report it?

18:44.500 --> 18:46.533
There's no concrete evidence yet.

18:46.533 --> 18:48.300
Cut the crap, you punk!

18:48.300 --> 18:49.667
You think I don't know you?

18:49.667 --> 18:52.267
Once you feel suspicious,
you just charge ahead.

18:52.267 --> 18:54.133
And I end up regretting it.

18:54.133 --> 18:56.600
Feels like I'm the one
who put Ki Beom in this mess.

18:56.600 --> 19:00.033
I actually learn from my mistakes,
unlike someone.

19:01.933 --> 19:03.900
Who is the suspect?

19:05.567 --> 19:07.700
I'll tell you when the investigation is over.

19:11.767 --> 19:13.233
Then what is this?

19:13.233 --> 19:15.433
"New forensic techniques." What's that about?

19:15.433 --> 19:16.467
Oh, that?

19:16.467 --> 19:17.833
That's not fully verified, either.

19:17.833 --> 19:21.333
Are you kidding me?

19:21.333 --> 19:23.900
What are you up to?

19:24.733 --> 19:26.367
What do you mean?

19:26.367 --> 19:30.633
I said I'd investigate properly
and report back, Prosecutor Cha.

19:30.633 --> 19:32.700
Just wait quietly.

19:32.700 --> 19:35.167
I only need to check just one thing.

19:35.167 --> 19:37.600
- "Just one thing"?
- Yeah.

19:37.600 --> 19:39.367
Just one thing.

19:42.900 --> 19:45.700
Oh, let me check one thing now.

19:45.700 --> 19:49.267
When you got stabbed,
did you see anything about the suspect?

19:49.267 --> 19:52.800
Like, was there anything
memorable about his walk?

19:52.800 --> 19:55.167
I don't know, darn it!

20:01.633 --> 20:03.567
Just one thing?

20:10.200 --> 20:11.800
- Sir!
- Yeah.

20:11.800 --> 20:13.167
Did you check it out?

20:13.167 --> 20:14.800
Yes.

20:14.800 --> 20:16.700
Im Seok Man is type B.

20:16.700 --> 20:20.233
[Medical Record, Im Seok Man, Type B]

20:22.033 --> 20:24.400
- Okay, let's go!
- Yes, sir.

20:26.700 --> 20:30.200
Now that it's exposed in the press,
an internal audit is unavoidable.

20:30.200 --> 20:32.533
What about keeping
the detectives' mouths shut?

20:32.533 --> 20:34.667
You don't need to worry.

20:34.667 --> 20:37.267
They won't bring me up.

20:41.300 --> 20:43.008
It so happens that

20:43.008 --> 20:45.567
your mother's condition has worsened.

20:46.733 --> 20:49.000
Take some time off for now.

20:49.000 --> 20:51.467
And stay out of any trouble.

20:54.816 --> 20:57.700
- But...
- About the audit,

20:57.700 --> 21:00.467
I'll wrap it up as quickly as possible.

21:00.467 --> 21:03.467
You're lucky you have your brother.

21:03.467 --> 21:06.267
How long are you going to rely on him?

21:12.400 --> 21:13.400
You're leaving?

21:13.400 --> 21:16.733
Yeah, I have to. I've got a mountain of work.

21:17.533 --> 21:19.167
My mother...

21:22.100 --> 21:24.200
Is she very ill?

21:37.267 --> 21:38.933
- Oh, you're here.
- Hello.

21:38.933 --> 21:41.533
Please put them somewhere visible.

21:41.533 --> 21:44.467
Oh my, your son brought you
beautiful flowers.

21:44.467 --> 21:46.700
I'll go put them in a vase.

21:47.733 --> 21:49.333
Mother.

21:50.933 --> 21:52.667
I'm here.

21:53.833 --> 21:55.967
Oh? Oh, dear.

21:55.967 --> 21:58.833
My baby's here?

21:58.833 --> 22:02.067
Si Young, where's your report card?

22:03.333 --> 22:06.500
Your grades didn't drop, right?

22:06.500 --> 22:09.500
You don't need to worry about that anymore.

22:10.133 --> 22:12.733
Si Young,

22:12.733 --> 22:15.600
don't go against your father.

22:15.600 --> 22:20.000
Your father is a scary man.

22:20.000 --> 22:25.167
He's the kind of person
who would kick you and me out.

22:25.167 --> 22:28.767
Mom, I'm a prosecutor.

22:28.767 --> 22:30.900
A prosecutor of the Republic of Korea.

22:30.900 --> 22:32.767
No one can treat me recklessly.

22:32.767 --> 22:34.900
Not even my father.

22:38.733 --> 22:40.900
And I'm getting married.

22:40.900 --> 22:43.000
To a daughter from a very prestigious family.

22:43.000 --> 22:44.667
Oh, dear.

22:44.667 --> 22:48.033
Oh my, thank you.

22:48.033 --> 22:52.200
Oh my, thank you. Thank you.

22:52.200 --> 22:54.933
Oh goodness, thank you.

22:54.933 --> 22:57.600
Please be at ease, Mom.

22:57.600 --> 22:59.333
Don't worry about anything.

22:59.333 --> 23:00.600
Okay.

23:00.600 --> 23:04.267
Oh my, thank you.

23:05.767 --> 23:08.033
Oh, thank you.

23:08.033 --> 23:11.133
Do you admit to the illegal arrest
of Lee Ki Beom?

23:11.133 --> 23:12.733
I told you already.

23:12.733 --> 23:14.800
I wasn't trying to illegally arrest him,

23:14.800 --> 23:20.864
but the prosecutor in charge was
in critical condition, so we had no choice!

23:23.067 --> 23:26.067
We didn't even know
when the prosecutor would wake up.

23:26.067 --> 23:28.400
And if the 48-hour
emergency detention limit passed,

23:28.400 --> 23:30.567
what would happen to the suspect?

23:30.567 --> 23:32.867
Are we just supposed to release him?

23:32.867 --> 23:35.133
What did you do while detaining him?

23:35.133 --> 23:36.200
Did you torture him or something?

23:36.200 --> 23:38.467
Torture? We just asked him questions.

23:38.467 --> 23:41.967
- You verbally abused him, right?
- Let's not be harsh on fellow detectives.

23:41.967 --> 23:47.167
Honestly, you know you have to shout a bit
and make things tense to get people to talk.

23:47.904 --> 23:49.681
Jeez...

23:52.967 --> 23:56.033
Seok Man, I steamed some potatoes.
Feed the kids and take care of the laundry.

23:56.033 --> 23:57.400
Yes, take care!

23:57.400 --> 23:58.767
Girls, Mom's heading out for a bit.

23:58.767 --> 24:01.933
- Bye, Mom!
- Okay.

24:17.833 --> 24:21.400
Hey girls, are you hungry?

24:21.400 --> 24:24.100
Want some potatoes?

24:25.767 --> 24:28.233
Kyeong Jin! I told you not to scribble here!

24:28.233 --> 24:30.967
This belongs to my friend!

24:30.967 --> 24:33.767
- Stop, don't cry.
- Uncle, I hate you.

24:33.767 --> 24:36.267
I'm sorry.

24:38.167 --> 24:41.833
You're hungry, right?
Should we eat some potatoes?

24:59.033 --> 25:00.633
Oh, it's hot!

25:00.633 --> 25:02.100
Me too, me too!

25:02.100 --> 25:04.100
I want to climb up too!

25:04.100 --> 25:05.667
Come on up, come on up!

25:05.667 --> 25:08.233
Girls, let's eat potatoes!

25:17.333 --> 25:19.467
Su Jin!

25:32.167 --> 25:34.267
Su Jin, are you okay? Are you hurt?

25:34.267 --> 25:35.433
No.

25:35.433 --> 25:37.867
Wow, Uncle is super fast.

25:37.867 --> 25:41.233
Of course, I'm really good at running.

25:44.233 --> 25:47.400
I told you not to climb dangerous places!

25:48.633 --> 25:50.833
I won't do it again.

25:50.833 --> 25:53.067
Promise!

25:53.067 --> 25:55.667
Promise!

25:55.667 --> 25:58.867
You must stay safe and grow up strong.

25:58.867 --> 26:01.967
So you can grow up fast and marry me someday.

26:21.867 --> 26:24.200
What brings you here again?

26:24.200 --> 26:27.933
Seok Man, you're type B, right?

26:28.633 --> 26:30.067
Yes.

26:30.067 --> 26:33.767
Oh, what should I do?

26:33.767 --> 26:37.900
I think I'm going to have to ask you
for an embarrassing favor.

26:39.200 --> 26:40.767
What kind of favor?

26:40.767 --> 26:44.433
Well, take off your underwear.

26:44.433 --> 26:46.133
What?

26:47.500 --> 26:49.367
Underwear.

26:54.500 --> 26:56.533
Deliver this to Dr. Jo right away.

26:56.533 --> 26:58.333
Yes, sir.

26:59.633 --> 27:01.900
[Hair of an unidentified suspect]

27:01.900 --> 27:06.467
But how did you get him
to take off his underwear?

27:06.467 --> 27:08.333
Are you curious?

27:10.133 --> 27:12.000
I begged him.

27:12.000 --> 27:14.533
How did you get him to do it?

27:14.533 --> 27:16.333
"The higher-ups set a quota.

27:16.333 --> 27:19.833
We each have to collect
pubic hair from 20 B-type men.

27:19.833 --> 27:22.400
Please help me out."

27:22.400 --> 27:24.700
He actually took off
his underwear? The suspect?

27:24.700 --> 27:26.800
I said the killer's the one who won't do it.

27:26.800 --> 27:28.533
Come on.

27:28.533 --> 27:30.933
Are you type B?
Want to take off your underwear?

27:30.933 --> 27:32.067
Want me to pull your hair out?

27:32.067 --> 27:33.933
Hurry up, you punk!

27:33.933 --> 27:36.500
And tell them to contact me
as soon as the results are out.

27:36.500 --> 27:38.700
- Yes, understood.
- Yeah.

27:48.633 --> 27:50.767
What is this?

27:50.767 --> 27:52.267
Give it here!

27:52.267 --> 27:53.767
Hold on.

27:53.767 --> 27:55.633
Unidentified suspect...

27:55.633 --> 27:57.300
Is there an unidentified suspect?

27:57.300 --> 27:59.333
- Is it a four-syllable name?
- Jeez.

28:00.467 --> 28:02.400
Who is it? You know, right?

28:02.400 --> 28:03.533
I don't know, either.

28:03.533 --> 28:06.633
- You're lying, punk.
- Stop it.

28:06.633 --> 28:09.100
You follow Kang Tae Joo around all day.
How can you not know?

28:09.100 --> 28:11.200
I really don't know!

28:11.200 --> 28:13.344
Be straight with me.

28:13.344 --> 28:17.184
- Huh? Bluffing, right?
- What do you mean, bluffing?

28:18.016 --> 28:21.567
You know Park Ae Sook's purse
was found at the bookstore, right?

28:21.567 --> 28:23.900
This guy was the one who put it there.

28:23.900 --> 28:25.567
- What?
- Do you think that's all?

28:25.567 --> 28:29.300
He was also at the Lee Joo Hee
murder scene, they say.

28:30.967 --> 28:32.633
I should go.

28:39.200 --> 28:40.633
Is that true?

28:40.633 --> 28:42.933
Yes, that's what Detective Park said.

28:42.933 --> 28:46.200
- He was at the Lee Joo Hee murder scene too?
- Yes.

28:47.033 --> 28:49.300
That can't be.

28:49.300 --> 28:54.233
Back then, Detective Do and I were
searching the area to catch Lee Ki Beom.

28:54.233 --> 28:56.133
There wasn't anyone suspicious.

28:56.133 --> 28:58.933
Except for the limping guy.

28:58.933 --> 29:00.193
Wait.

29:00.193 --> 29:01.767
The limping guy?

29:01.767 --> 29:02.967
Yes.

29:02.967 --> 29:04.233
I only need to check just one thing.

29:04.233 --> 29:06.933
When you got stabbed,
did you see anything about the suspect?

29:06.933 --> 29:10.900
Like, was there anything
memorable about his walk?

29:11.533 --> 29:14.333
Why are you telling me this only now!

29:14.333 --> 29:17.433
- Who was it? Did you identify him?
- Well...

29:17.433 --> 29:19.133
You didn't?

29:20.067 --> 29:22.933
He just knows Lee Ki Beom so...

29:24.733 --> 29:26.100
He's an acquaintance of Lee Ki Beom?

29:26.100 --> 29:27.700
Yes.

29:28.480 --> 29:30.967
But please don't worry.

29:30.967 --> 29:34.967
- We made sure he keeps his mouth shut.
- I'm not asking about that. Who is he!

29:43.097 --> 29:46.267
[Kangseng Branch]

29:46.267 --> 29:49.967
When you were arrested,

29:49.967 --> 29:52.267
who saw you?

29:52.267 --> 29:54.433
I heard it's someone you know.

29:55.333 --> 29:57.100
I don't know.

29:58.933 --> 30:01.900
I think you've misunderstood something.

30:01.900 --> 30:06.267
Evidence has emerged suggesting
he might be the real killer.

30:06.267 --> 30:07.900
What do you mean?

30:07.900 --> 30:09.367
It's him!

30:09.367 --> 30:13.533
He's the one who placed
Park Ae Sook's purse in your bookstore.

30:13.533 --> 30:18.233
You know that purse is the decisive evidence
framing you as the real killer, right?

30:18.867 --> 30:21.600
That's why we're investigating you.

30:21.600 --> 30:22.976
Cooperate with us.

30:25.633 --> 30:30.433
Honestly, if he's the real killer,
isn't that good for you too?

30:32.000 --> 30:34.100
Name him.

30:34.100 --> 30:36.333
That guy can't be the one.

30:38.967 --> 30:41.300
- What?
- He's not the killer!

30:41.300 --> 30:42.733
You punk!

30:42.733 --> 30:46.333
The prosecutor is speaking. How dare you!

30:46.333 --> 30:48.667
- That's enough.
- I'll finish up shortly.

30:48.667 --> 30:51.067
Enough, enough!

30:52.533 --> 30:54.633
Get your head straight!

31:06.533 --> 31:09.400
It was the same back then too.

31:09.400 --> 31:12.867
They told me to name one fellow protester.

31:12.867 --> 31:15.067
And they'd let me go.

31:15.967 --> 31:20.033
They coaxed, soothed, hit, and threatened me.

31:20.033 --> 31:22.100
So I named him.

31:23.167 --> 31:27.533
I got out safely as promised,
but my friend...

31:29.467 --> 31:31.533
My friend didn't get out safely.

31:35.133 --> 31:38.267
I could never go back to the school

31:39.200 --> 31:41.733
where my friend never returned.

31:47.167 --> 31:51.100
I can't lose another friend like that.

31:59.633 --> 32:02.167
It looks like Detective Kang is
on a wild goose chase this time.

32:02.167 --> 32:04.667
He can't even walk properly.

32:04.667 --> 32:07.333
He's escaped multiple times,
but how could a limping man...

32:07.333 --> 32:09.933
No, no!

32:09.933 --> 32:12.400
Can't you see that?

32:12.400 --> 32:13.433
Pardon?

32:13.433 --> 32:15.033
Lee Ki Beom, that punk,

32:15.033 --> 32:18.100
if he's the killer, would he react like that?

32:23.100 --> 32:25.833
Is Lee Ki Beom really the killer?

32:33.700 --> 32:35.533
Ki Beom!

32:35.533 --> 32:36.700
Tae Joo!

32:36.700 --> 32:37.900
You can't.

32:37.900 --> 32:40.033
Visits are not allowed.

32:43.400 --> 32:45.367
We're family.

32:47.500 --> 32:49.867
[Police Officer ID: Kang Tae Joo]
We just need five minutes. Five minutes.

32:54.000 --> 32:56.167
Only five minutes.

33:04.833 --> 33:07.467
How are you feeling?

33:08.967 --> 33:11.167
I'm getting better.

33:16.567 --> 33:18.167
I'm sorry.

33:19.700 --> 33:22.800
Honestly, I suspected you.

33:22.800 --> 33:27.967
When I heard you followed Min Ji that day,
I thought maybe you did more than

33:27.967 --> 33:29.633
just gave her an umbrella.

33:33.433 --> 33:35.733
That's your job, right?

33:36.933 --> 33:39.067
I don't blame you.

33:43.567 --> 33:45.200
Tae Joo.

33:46.500 --> 33:48.867
I can get out, right?

33:51.933 --> 33:55.233
I need to get out
before Sun Young gives birth.

33:56.667 --> 33:59.067
By then, it'd be too late.

33:59.867 --> 34:03.033
Before Sun Young starts showing,

34:03.033 --> 34:05.100
you need to hold the wedding.

34:07.633 --> 34:09.267
Okay.

34:12.300 --> 34:15.500
[Italian Bakery]

34:18.100 --> 34:20.500
You must have been
shocked by the news, right?

34:21.833 --> 34:26.633
I never imagined Lee Ki Beom
would be illegally arrested.

34:26.633 --> 34:28.736
I'm ashamed as a prosecutor.

34:28.736 --> 34:30.467
No,

34:30.467 --> 34:33.300
you got injured while rescuing me
and were in the hospital.

34:33.300 --> 34:36.533
No, that can't be an excuse.

34:36.533 --> 34:38.867
I'll handle the investigation
properly from now on.

34:38.867 --> 34:42.133
Does that mean Ki Beom can be released?

34:42.133 --> 34:45.333
Fortunately, there's a witness.

34:45.333 --> 34:48.133
They say it's Lee Ki Beom's friend.
If we find him...

34:48.133 --> 34:51.633
Which of Ki Beom's friends
are you talking about?

34:51.633 --> 34:54.133
I don't really know his name, but,

34:54.133 --> 34:57.533
only that he has a leg problem.

34:58.500 --> 35:00.533
Im Seok Man?

35:01.667 --> 35:03.367
Seok Man?

35:03.367 --> 35:05.000
Who?

35:06.933 --> 35:08.300
Officer.

35:08.300 --> 35:11.367
Find out everything you can
about Im Seok Man right now.

35:11.367 --> 35:14.100
See if he has a criminal record
and what his blood type is.

35:14.100 --> 35:16.367
His blood type is B.

35:18.767 --> 35:20.967
He doesn't have a criminal record.

35:26.900 --> 35:29.267
You two, go grab some coffee for a bit.

35:29.267 --> 35:30.867
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

35:41.300 --> 35:42.933
What is this?

35:42.933 --> 35:47.633
Data comparing the suspect's body hair
found at the scene with that of Im Seok Man.

35:49.500 --> 35:50.700
Is that true?

35:50.700 --> 35:53.067
Yes, the suspect hair sample you sent

35:53.067 --> 35:55.467
also showed high levels
of titanium and sodium.

35:55.467 --> 35:56.533
It matches the killer.

35:56.533 --> 35:57.733
[Radioisotope Analysis Report]

35:57.733 --> 36:01.000
Radioisotope analysis?

36:01.000 --> 36:04.733
Is this it? Is this what you call
a scientific investigation technique?

36:04.733 --> 36:07.767
You wanted to know.

36:08.867 --> 36:09.984
Not the National Forensic Service

36:09.984 --> 36:12.033
but the Korea
Atomic Energy Research Institute?

36:12.733 --> 36:14.067
You see that?

36:14.067 --> 36:16.667
[Korea Atomic Energy Research Institute]
The suspect is a laborer who sweats a lot,

36:16.667 --> 36:20.867
seemingly in a job like a welder
who works with metal.

36:20.867 --> 36:24.867
Im Seok Man fits this report perfectly.

36:24.867 --> 36:29.633
And the one who brought Park Ae Sook's purse
to Lee Ki Beom's bookstore

36:29.633 --> 36:31.567
was Im Seok Man.

36:33.800 --> 36:35.900
Do you think that's a coincidence?

36:37.133 --> 36:39.133
They said Im Seok Man can't even run.

36:39.133 --> 36:40.833
He can run.

36:41.567 --> 36:43.833
I saw it with my own eyes.

36:45.900 --> 36:47.933
This is driving me crazy.

36:51.167 --> 36:53.433
Changing suspects before trial?

36:53.433 --> 36:55.667
That's not a big deal.

36:55.667 --> 36:58.600
But once the trial begins,

36:58.600 --> 37:00.900
there's no turning back.

37:04.633 --> 37:09.200
He'll do anything to
avoid disappointing his father.

37:09.200 --> 37:13.633
If the suspect you indicted
is found not guilty,

37:13.633 --> 37:16.867
with your father's election coming up soon...

37:18.800 --> 37:21.000
Are you really okay with that?

37:25.700 --> 37:28.667
Seok Man's not here.

37:28.667 --> 37:30.600
Where did he go?

37:30.600 --> 37:33.000
I'm not sure. Did Seok Man go to work today?

37:33.000 --> 37:36.733
What work is there? No outside jobs today.

37:36.733 --> 37:39.967
He said he was going to meet his friend.

37:46.767 --> 37:48.433
Seok Man!

37:50.933 --> 37:53.333
What are you doing here at this hour?

37:53.333 --> 37:55.000
Well...

37:55.700 --> 37:58.267
I have something to return to you.

38:01.333 --> 38:03.000
What friend?

38:03.000 --> 38:07.033
I don't know. He said
he was returning a handkerchief.

38:07.033 --> 38:09.200
Is this it?

38:09.200 --> 38:12.033
Hey, this isn't yours!

38:13.633 --> 38:17.533
Hey, can I take a look at it?

38:40.233 --> 38:42.700
What is it?

38:42.700 --> 38:44.633
A handkerchief.

38:44.633 --> 38:46.667
A handkerchief?

38:47.500 --> 38:49.967
You mean Ki Beom's handkerchief?

38:49.967 --> 38:51.167
Yeah.

38:51.167 --> 38:53.833
Why do you have that?

38:53.833 --> 38:56.700
Ki Beom seemed to have left it at my place.

38:56.700 --> 38:58.400
When exactly was that?

38:58.400 --> 38:59.808
Well...

39:00.500 --> 39:02.967
- I'm not sure.
- Think carefully.

39:02.967 --> 39:05.300
Since when was it there?

39:05.300 --> 39:07.100
I don't really remember.

39:09.733 --> 39:13.067
Where is it now? Is it at your house?

39:13.067 --> 39:15.867
- Yeah.
- Let's go to your house.

39:15.867 --> 39:17.467
Now?

39:18.367 --> 39:20.200
What are you doing? Hurry up.

39:20.200 --> 39:22.100
Okay.

39:27.733 --> 39:29.733
Sun Young, slow down a bit.

39:29.733 --> 39:32.367
Hurry up. We don't have time.

39:32.367 --> 39:36.267
Are you mad at me?
Because of the handkerchief?

39:38.367 --> 39:40.600
That too, and...

39:41.400 --> 39:43.633
You saw Ki Beom getting arrested, right?

39:43.633 --> 39:44.933
Why didn't you say anything?

39:44.933 --> 39:48.133
You knew I was looking for Ki Beom, so why?

39:48.133 --> 39:50.000
I...

39:50.000 --> 39:52.433
I really thought

39:52.433 --> 39:55.100
Ki Beom was the killer.

39:55.100 --> 39:56.500
What?

39:56.500 --> 39:59.933
Otherwise, the police wouldn't
have arrested him so forcefully.

39:59.933 --> 40:02.800
How could you suspect Ki Beom?

40:02.800 --> 40:04.333
You know him better than anyone.

40:04.333 --> 40:05.900
But the police back then were so...

40:05.900 --> 40:07.900
Do you think everything
the police do is right?

40:07.900 --> 40:09.967
Do you really believe that?

40:09.967 --> 40:13.067
There are innocent people
in this world, many of them!

40:13.067 --> 40:15.267
Ki Beom is one of them!

40:15.267 --> 40:17.800
It's all because of that handkerchief!

40:20.400 --> 40:23.633
You really don't remember
when it first showed up at your place?

40:26.200 --> 40:27.800
Well...

40:29.800 --> 40:33.700
Ji Won was hospitalized
on the same day as me, so...

40:33.700 --> 40:34.967
September 7th!

40:34.967 --> 40:37.033
Was it before or after that?

40:38.633 --> 40:41.867
- I don't really remember...
- Don't just say you don't remember.

40:41.867 --> 40:44.067
Try to think carefully.

40:46.000 --> 40:47.567
Maybe before?

40:47.567 --> 40:50.500
Before? Are you sure?

40:51.267 --> 40:52.600
Then what happens?

40:52.600 --> 40:54.000
What else?

40:54.000 --> 40:56.700
It means he can clear his name!

40:57.800 --> 41:01.400
After Ki Beom lost it,
the killer must have had it,

41:01.400 --> 41:05.467
so the killer isn't Ki Beom but the one
who had that handkerchief at the time...

41:30.633 --> 41:32.333
Sun Young.

41:34.233 --> 41:36.367
Don't come any closer!

41:42.500 --> 41:44.200
Don't tell me

41:45.933 --> 41:48.000
the killer

41:48.000 --> 41:49.700
is you?

41:50.700 --> 41:52.700
What?

41:52.700 --> 41:54.600
Answer me!

41:57.800 --> 42:01.533
You... How could you...

42:01.533 --> 42:04.767
You trust Ki Beom that much,
but why not me...

42:06.633 --> 42:08.300
Sun Young, are you okay?

42:08.300 --> 42:09.667
Stay back!

42:09.667 --> 42:11.900
Don't come near me!

42:11.900 --> 42:15.700
Why are you acting like this? What did I do?

42:15.700 --> 42:17.367
Sun Young!

42:29.800 --> 42:31.533
Sun Young!

42:36.267 --> 42:38.933
Im Seok Man, you punk!

42:38.933 --> 42:41.000
- Sun Young, are you okay?
- Im Seok Man!

42:43.300 --> 42:45.100
Are you alright?

42:45.967 --> 42:51.100
You are under arrest
as a serial murder suspect.

42:51.100 --> 42:55.567
No, it's not me!

42:58.900 --> 43:00.600
Stop this!

43:03.100 --> 43:04.900
It really wasn't me.

43:04.900 --> 43:07.067
Why would I ever kill anyone?

43:07.067 --> 43:08.933
Why would I...

43:11.200 --> 43:13.633
Then what is this?

43:13.633 --> 43:15.933
How did this end up with you?

43:15.933 --> 43:17.567
That's...

43:18.867 --> 43:21.267
I have no idea.

43:21.933 --> 43:25.000
Obviously Ki Beom must've dropped it.

43:25.000 --> 43:26.433
That's just how he is.

43:26.433 --> 43:31.533
He says it's precious, but then
he just drops things like that.

43:32.500 --> 43:36.800
After all the efforts Sun Young
put into making it...

43:39.767 --> 43:43.067
There are a few guys who pick fights
with Ki Beom sometimes.

43:43.067 --> 43:47.733
They say he flirts with all the women
in the neighborhood.

43:47.733 --> 43:52.667
I guess they're jealous
because Ki Beom is so popular.

43:55.300 --> 43:57.133
So,

43:59.200 --> 44:01.400
you like Sun Young, huh?

44:02.167 --> 44:04.667
That's why you hate Ki Beom?

44:04.667 --> 44:05.900
Because Ki Beom likes Sun Young?

44:05.900 --> 44:08.367
I liked her first!

44:08.367 --> 44:09.733
What?

44:09.733 --> 44:12.300
I said I liked her first.

44:18.700 --> 44:21.567
- Whoa.
- It's just like mine.

44:21.567 --> 44:23.400
It's really pretty.

44:25.567 --> 44:28.767
I made this myself.

44:28.767 --> 44:31.633
- Really?
- Yeah.

44:31.633 --> 44:33.233
Thanks.

44:37.467 --> 44:39.433
I've got something for you too.

44:39.433 --> 44:41.100
Something for me?

44:42.967 --> 44:44.867
Close your eyes.

45:14.100 --> 45:16.967
Even though he knew I liked her,

45:18.333 --> 45:21.500
he still confessed to Sun Young.

45:23.100 --> 45:25.267
What kind of friend does that?

45:25.267 --> 45:27.733
They've spent so much time together,

45:27.733 --> 45:30.833
and you just barged in like that, you punk.

45:31.500 --> 45:34.833
You planted that purse
to frame Ki Beom, didn't you?

45:34.833 --> 45:36.600
No.

45:36.600 --> 45:37.767
That's not true, Tae Joo!

45:37.767 --> 45:39.433
Don't call me that!

45:44.400 --> 45:47.233
It's disgusting and terrifying
that someone like you

45:47.233 --> 45:49.700
was around my family.

45:49.700 --> 45:52.800
Do you know how many people
died because of you?

45:53.633 --> 45:55.767
And you still call yourself human?

45:58.567 --> 45:59.600
Tae Joo...

45:59.600 --> 46:02.400
Say my name again,

46:02.400 --> 46:05.000
and I'll tear your mouth open.

46:10.600 --> 46:13.033
Confess and repent as soon as possible.

46:13.033 --> 46:17.867
Spend the rest of your life
atoning for those you killed.

46:27.300 --> 46:29.867
Over the past two years in Kangseng,

46:29.867 --> 46:34.167
seven women were murdered
in the Kangseng Serial Murder Case.

46:34.167 --> 46:37.500
The suspect has finally been arrested.

46:37.500 --> 46:39.433
How did you manage to arrest the suspect?

46:39.433 --> 46:43.733
We found the item used in the crime
at the suspect's residence,

46:43.733 --> 46:47.600
and through radioactive isotope analysis
by the Atomic Energy Research Institute,

46:47.600 --> 46:50.600
we confirmed the suspect is the killer.

46:50.600 --> 46:53.933
So you're certain
he's the real killer this time?

46:53.933 --> 46:57.400
Yes, we're certain.

47:00.768 --> 47:04.133
Huh? What's all this?

47:04.133 --> 47:05.700
Are we having a feast?

47:05.700 --> 47:06.933
Ji Won!

47:06.933 --> 47:08.233
Ji Won, you're here.

47:08.233 --> 47:09.500
You too, hurry up and help.

47:09.500 --> 47:12.433
There's still a ton to do.

47:12.433 --> 47:14.467
You're missing the most important thing.

47:14.467 --> 47:17.900
For someone just out of jail,
nothing beats tofu.

47:17.900 --> 47:18.967
Tofu? Come on.

47:18.967 --> 47:20.667
On a day like this, we should give him meat.

47:20.667 --> 47:22.067
Jeez, ma'am.

47:22.067 --> 47:26.467
He needs to eat this
so he doesn't end up going back there.

47:26.467 --> 47:28.967
Bring it here. I'll cook it.

47:29.767 --> 47:32.352
When is Ki Beom coming back?

47:33.533 --> 47:34.560
Ki Hwan went to pick him up,

47:34.560 --> 47:36.733
- so he'll be here soon.
- Oh.

47:54.567 --> 47:57.200
Everyone's waiting for you at home.

47:57.200 --> 47:59.333
Sun Young is there too.

47:59.333 --> 48:00.767
She is?

48:00.767 --> 48:04.533
Mom gave you two her permission.

48:04.533 --> 48:06.533
Is that true?

48:06.533 --> 48:08.333
But, how...

48:08.333 --> 48:11.033
Sun Young really went through a lot.

48:13.533 --> 48:15.833
I can't wait to see everyone.

48:21.767 --> 48:23.467
Hey, what's wrong?

48:24.967 --> 48:26.467
I'm just a little hungry.

48:26.467 --> 48:28.067
Oh, man.

48:28.067 --> 48:30.267
You must be starving.

48:30.267 --> 48:32.567
The food in detention center
can't be any good, right?

48:32.567 --> 48:35.833
Mom actually prepared a lot of food for you.

48:35.833 --> 48:37.200
Oh, right!

48:37.200 --> 48:39.833
Your sister-in-law told us to get a cake.

48:39.833 --> 48:42.433
Your birthday has already passed.

48:42.433 --> 48:44.867
What cake?

48:44.867 --> 48:45.933
Let's just go straight home.

48:45.933 --> 48:48.800
No, it'll only take a minute.

48:52.300 --> 48:53.933
- Ki Hwan.
- Yeah?

48:53.933 --> 48:55.433
I'm gonna sleep for a bit.

48:55.433 --> 48:58.167
Yeah, sure. Sleep comfortably.

48:58.167 --> 49:01.233
I'll wake you up once we're home.

49:18.367 --> 49:20.433
Ki Beom.

49:20.433 --> 49:23.500
Ki Beom, wake up! You're home.

49:31.333 --> 49:33.433
Look at your bruised face.

49:33.433 --> 49:35.733
You've been through a lot, right?

49:43.133 --> 49:46.033
I thought I'd never see you again.

49:46.033 --> 49:48.133
Don't say that.

49:49.000 --> 49:53.267
I'm really glad you came back safe.

50:01.267 --> 50:03.167
Sun Young.

50:05.800 --> 50:07.467
Let's live

50:08.500 --> 50:10.667
like normal people now.

50:27.000 --> 50:30.800
Get married like others,

50:32.333 --> 50:36.667
have kids like others,

50:38.800 --> 50:41.233
and grow old together.

50:43.833 --> 50:46.624
Just like everyone else.

51:06.633 --> 51:09.000
Just like

51:09.000 --> 51:10.767
everyone else...

51:23.300 --> 51:25.100
Hey, Ki Beom, I went in

51:25.100 --> 51:28.167
and saw your favorite cake right there, so...

51:30.667 --> 51:32.267
Are you sleeping?

51:35.333 --> 51:36.933
Ki Beom?

51:38.467 --> 51:40.133
Ki Beom!

51:41.700 --> 51:43.433
What's wrong with you?

51:43.433 --> 51:45.533
Hey, Ki Beom!

51:45.533 --> 51:47.900
Hey, hey... Ki Beom!

51:48.833 --> 51:50.767
Hey, Ki Beom!

51:50.767 --> 51:53.267
Ki Beom, snap out of it!

51:53.267 --> 51:55.167
Ki Beom...

51:56.667 --> 51:58.433
Ki Beom!

51:58.433 --> 52:00.400
What's wrong with you?

52:00.400 --> 52:02.300
Hey!

52:09.133 --> 52:10.900
Ki Beom!

52:10.900 --> 52:15.233
[Stop]

52:20.667 --> 52:25.433
[Murderer, get out
Condolences]

52:35.633 --> 52:38.333
Look over there. That's Kang Tae Joo, right?

52:38.333 --> 52:40.000
Yeah, that's him.

52:40.000 --> 52:41.500
That punk took Ki Beom away.

52:41.500 --> 52:43.400
- Oh, dear.
- How shameless.

52:43.400 --> 52:45.633
How dare you even show your face here?

53:04.633 --> 53:06.300
Tae Joo...

53:10.567 --> 53:13.000
Where is Ki Beom?

53:15.400 --> 53:18.333
You killed him.

53:18.333 --> 53:21.067
You killed him!

53:21.067 --> 53:24.000
Ki Beom...

53:24.000 --> 53:26.433
I'm... I'm sorry.

53:27.467 --> 53:29.467
Bring him back!

53:29.467 --> 53:35.700
Bring my precious boy back to me!

53:35.700 --> 53:39.867
My sweet, kind boy...

53:39.867 --> 53:43.800
My precious boy...

53:43.800 --> 53:48.333
Bring him back!

53:48.333 --> 53:54.000
Bring him back! Bring him back!

53:56.367 --> 53:58.133
Take her inside.

54:13.400 --> 54:15.067
Ki Hwan...

54:17.467 --> 54:21.133
I have something to say to Ki Beom.

54:21.133 --> 54:23.033
I'm sorry!

54:25.533 --> 54:28.200
But I can't see you anymore.

54:28.933 --> 54:30.900
Please just go.

54:37.367 --> 54:39.133
Ki Hwan...

54:40.967 --> 54:42.733
Go.

55:13.233 --> 55:17.633
They said it was sepsis
caused by organ failure.

55:17.633 --> 55:20.967
It seems his condition
was already serious in detention.

55:21.633 --> 55:25.067
Even the guards told him to
go to the hospital first after release.

55:26.200 --> 55:28.633
How could a perfectly healthy person

55:29.433 --> 55:31.633
end up like this overnight?

55:34.733 --> 55:36.500
I...

55:39.067 --> 55:41.800
I did this. It was me.

55:41.800 --> 55:44.667
I ruined everything.

55:44.667 --> 55:46.633
I...

55:49.133 --> 55:51.367
killed Ki Beom.

55:51.367 --> 55:52.400
Tae Joo.

55:52.400 --> 55:53.967
- I...
- Tae Joo.

55:53.967 --> 55:56.567
Look at me. Look at me!

55:57.767 --> 56:00.300
You can't fall apart now.

56:00.300 --> 56:04.467
We have to make those punks
who did that to Ki Beom pay.

56:04.467 --> 56:07.067
None of them even came to the funeral.

56:07.067 --> 56:09.733
No one is even asking for forgiveness.

56:11.233 --> 56:13.833
How can people be like this?

56:41.567 --> 56:42.800
Where is Cha Si Young?

56:42.800 --> 56:45.467
He went to a funeral.

56:45.467 --> 56:47.267
A funeral?

56:48.900 --> 56:50.667
That punk?

56:51.872 --> 56:54.102
[Condolences]

57:02.200 --> 57:05.567
- Assemblyman!
- Oh my, it's been a while.

57:05.567 --> 57:07.800
Take it easy.

57:07.800 --> 57:12.840
- It's been so long.
- How do you do?

57:39.167 --> 57:40.800
Ki Beom...

57:43.700 --> 57:46.067
This place is like a festival.

58:01.233 --> 58:03.867
Without any guilt,

58:06.767 --> 58:09.567
or any sorrow,

58:11.600 --> 58:15.067
they just laugh and chatter.

58:38.500 --> 58:41.533
To those who caused your death,

58:43.200 --> 58:45.133
you've already

58:46.533 --> 58:48.467
been forgotten.

59:28.533 --> 59:31.367
So don't forgive anyone.

59:32.433 --> 59:34.967
Even me,

59:34.967 --> 59:37.500
who is helplessly kneeling

59:39.567 --> 59:41.567
before them.

59:46.000 --> 59:48.033
Have you

59:48.033 --> 59:52.433
ever been found out as the killer?

59:55.067 --> 59:56.933
I guess not.

59:56.933 --> 01:00:00.800
If I had, I wouldn't have gotten away
with it this long, right?

01:00:00.800 --> 01:00:03.567
Don't you agree?

01:00:05.367 --> 01:00:07.433
What about Ki Beom?

01:00:10.433 --> 01:00:12.233
Did Ki Beom

01:00:12.933 --> 01:00:17.067
know you were the killer?

01:00:24.467 --> 01:00:28.167
No, he didn't.

01:00:37.433 --> 01:00:41.067
Ki Beom, I'll buy you a cake, so just wait...

01:00:43.333 --> 01:00:45.367
Hey, Ki Beom, what's wrong?

01:00:46.633 --> 01:00:47.833
Are you hurt somewhere?

01:00:47.833 --> 01:00:49.833
Why are you like this?

01:00:55.833 --> 01:00:57.800
What's wrong with you?

01:00:58.500 --> 01:01:01.300
- Ki Hwan...
- Oh dear.

01:01:01.300 --> 01:01:03.233
This isn't good.
We should go to the hospital.

01:01:03.233 --> 01:01:05.000
Did you do that?

01:01:05.000 --> 01:01:06.667
What?

01:01:06.667 --> 01:01:08.733
You told Tae Joo

01:01:11.000 --> 01:01:13.533
that I followed Min Ji out?

01:01:14.933 --> 01:01:16.200
Huh?

01:01:16.200 --> 01:01:20.267
That wasn't me. It was you.

01:01:24.733 --> 01:01:26.667
It's raining!

01:01:31.067 --> 01:01:32.133
This won't do.

01:01:32.133 --> 01:01:35.700
I'll bring her an umbrella and then go home.
You just lock up and go.

01:01:35.700 --> 01:01:37.467
Don't touch this! I'll deal with it tomorrow.

01:01:37.467 --> 01:01:38.767
[Umbrella, 600 won]
Got it.

01:01:38.767 --> 01:01:43.333
You said you'd bring Min Ji an umbrella

01:01:43.333 --> 01:01:45.267
and followed her out, right?

01:01:52.067 --> 01:01:53.933
Did I?

01:01:55.800 --> 01:01:58.833
You just got confused, huh?

01:02:04.200 --> 01:02:05.933
Of course.

01:02:06.600 --> 01:02:08.933
What other reason would there be?

01:02:10.633 --> 01:02:12.767
You need to get to a hospital.

01:02:24.733 --> 01:02:26.500
Ki Beom...

01:02:27.167 --> 01:02:28.933
Ki Hwan.

01:02:31.267 --> 01:02:33.300
Don't touch Sun Young,

01:02:34.867 --> 01:02:36.700
no matter what.

01:02:41.367 --> 01:02:43.367
Mark my words.

01:03:55.600 --> 01:03:57.733
I need to go get the cake.

01:03:58.400 --> 01:04:00.500
Just wait a little!

01:04:02.500 --> 01:04:04.433
Ki Beom

01:04:05.533 --> 01:04:08.067
knew nothing.

01:04:19.267 --> 01:04:22.100
So Ki Beom knew, huh?

01:04:28.633 --> 01:04:31.200
I said he didn't know.

01:04:37.533 --> 01:04:40.433
Why won't you believe me?

01:04:44.967 --> 01:04:48.467
It doesn't mean you're certain

01:04:48.467 --> 01:04:50.767
that he didn't know.

01:04:53.833 --> 01:04:56.133
It's still only an assumption.

01:05:09.033 --> 01:05:10.933
Lee Ki Hwan!

01:05:14.567 --> 01:05:16.633
Sit.

01:05:16.633 --> 01:05:18.867
Let's talk more.

01:05:24.800 --> 01:05:26.533
That name.

01:05:29.000 --> 01:05:31.500
It's been a long time since I've heard that.

01:05:48.500 --> 01:05:51.700
Now you're starting to
sound like the Tae Joo I knew.

01:06:32.867 --> 01:06:33.900
Now, move aside.

01:06:33.900 --> 01:06:36.967
We seek the death penalty,
the maximum sentence under the law.

01:06:36.967 --> 01:06:38.133
Are you still human?

01:06:38.133 --> 01:06:40.467
How could you frame me with that accusation?

01:06:40.467 --> 01:06:43.533
Seok Man, did you really kill them?
Those women...

01:06:43.533 --> 01:06:44.633
I killed them...

01:06:44.633 --> 01:06:47.533
Tae Joo, let's never see each other again.

01:06:47.533 --> 01:06:49.433
This is... Sun Young! Kang Sun Young!

01:06:49.433 --> 01:06:51.800
I think Sun Young is trying to kill herself.

01:06:51.800 --> 01:06:52.833
How can we give up?

01:06:52.833 --> 01:06:55.500
One person is dead,
and the other is falsely accused.

01:06:55.500 --> 01:06:57.833
Sun Young, it's dangerous! Come down!
